Seek on File Handles Test
=========================

Test 1: Create file and test Seek(BEGINNING)
  Seek(BEGIN) returned: 10
  PASS: Seek(BEGIN) returns previous position

Test 2: Seek to end of file
  Seek(END) returned: 0
  PASS: Seek(END) from start returns 0
  Position after Seek(END): 10
  PASS: Seek(END) moved to end of file

Test 3: Seek with OFFSET_CURRENT
  Seek(CURRENT, -2) returned: 5
  PASS: Seek(CURRENT) returns previous position
  Current position: 3
  PASS: Position is 3 after seek back 2 from 5

Test 4: Seek beyond EOF
  Seek(100) returned: -1
  IoErr: 219
  PASS: Seek beyond EOF returned ERROR_SEEK_ERROR
  PASS: Failed seek left the position unchanged
  Seek(-1) returned: -1, IoErr: 219
  PASS: Seek before start returned ERROR_SEEK_ERROR

=== Test Summary ===
Passed: 8
Failed: 0
